      "sourceFileHash": "c706c7c01be957fb7efdada160ee5b16a13adb7e9bba1f79b68ebc7a28a219d3",
      "originalText": "歓迎",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "72aa8dec4a884bb97db463c57c54ffcb",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900600-Kashimoto-Riko/edu-306.kojo",
      "key": "welcome",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "welcome",
        "lines",
        0
      ],
      "originalHash": "47aaa65b4420d745dd40f1eb38b5a3546ab549d3150d50c7c2df9eaf2f6603c3",
      "sourceFileHash": "c706c7c01be957fb7efdada160ee5b16a13adb7e9bba1f79b68ebc7a28a219d3",
      "originalText": "その日、%YOU% はトレ室の入り口で、待ち構えている女性に気づいた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "c1f99dcc25e5876e143e3b9191c94bdf",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900600-Kashimoto-Riko/edu-306.kojo",
      "key": "welcome",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "welcome",
        "lines",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "529ed5af51b02e8a1f007502d856fb36872d815da18fe2a545f38106dd0e0022",
      "sourceFileHash": "c706c7c01be957fb7efdada160ee5b16a13adb7e9bba1f79b68ebc7a28a219d3",
      "originalText": "学園の代理理事長、%CHARA% だと気づき、急いで挨拶した。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "31adb5ffa3e209645c7cdede77009085",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900600-Kashimoto-Riko/edu-306.kojo",
      "key": "welcome",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "welcome",
        "lines",
        2
      ],
      "originalHash": "fc824369a8b80bb93e6069f60b5a2afd54efbca4c22afee39d76f08cdfd05648",
      "sourceFileHash": "c706c7c01be957fb7efdada160ee5b16a13adb7e9bba1f79b68ebc7a28a219d3",
      "originalText": "%CHARA% の声は丁寧で、どこか厳かだった。新人トレーナーは何かと忙しいでしょうが、学園の同僚として、顔くらいは合わせておくべきです、と。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "c19a2a3a9af1b872b974652ff7c28905",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900600-Kashimoto-Riko/edu-306.kojo",
      "key": "welcome",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "welcome",
        "lines",
        3
      ],
      "originalHash": "763b9143e78f7fd4246989d53f4a3bfc6e14d3ff845686a744dc9e840c810c39",
      "sourceFileHash": "c706c7c01be957fb7efdada160ee5b16a13adb7e9bba1f79b68ebc7a28a219d3",
      "originalText": "すぐ近くのトレーナー室は全トレーナー共用なので、%YOU% も使って構わない。もちろん、これまで通りトレ室で執務してもいい、とのことだった。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "fb087db7848a2cdaee027c9986959eaf",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900600-Kashimoto-Riko/edu-306.kojo",
      "key": "welcome",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "welcome",
        "lines",
        4,
        "content",
        0
      ],
      "originalHash": "a112f081ae94f1f62ffc413de4a5f58e7b0031986737f78b1308d8b17a8b91eb",
      "sourceFileHash": "c706c7c01be957fb7efdada160ee5b16a13adb7e9bba1f79b68ebc7a28a219d3",
      "originalText": "他に相談したいことがあれば、トレーナー室に彼女を訪ねればいい。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "b8d9d2bd6470a25232889281041780a1",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900600-Kashimoto-Riko/edu-306.kojo",
      "key": "welcome",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "welcome",
        "lines",
        4,
        "content",
        2,
        "content"
      ],
      "originalHash": "3192f2ac3b22c62e26e9e1c0f070fb294aa6f1184c82e462b5e1bb1b206c76e2",
      "sourceFileHash": "c706c7c01be957fb7efdada160ee5b16a13adb7e9bba1f79b68ebc7a28a219d3",
      "originalText": "理事長",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "ceeff595ceee7034dff3daf6993ecaf3",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900600-Kashimoto-Riko/edu-306.kojo",
      "key": "welcome",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "welcome",
        "lines",
        4,
        "content",
        4
      ],
      "originalHash": "f6e240d117c452658abd5cb896c20472544fc445645bac1e5bd8e6c095065498",
      "sourceFileHash": "c706c7c01be957fb7efdada160ee5b16a13adb7e9bba1f79b68ebc7a28a219d3",
      "originalText": "が出張で、彼女が代理を務めるときは、トレーナー室の",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "466e8b86d0d480240b91467c07bd2085",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900600-Kashimoto-Riko/edu-306.kojo",
      "key": "welcome",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "welcome",
        "lines",
        4,
        "content",
        6,
        "content"
      ],
      "originalHash": "c31845dcff3c934ef2802bf31a37d4e7fa01fab3ebb389eba759513b6224508a",
      "sourceFileHash": "c706c7c01be957fb7efdada160ee5b16a13adb7e9bba1f79b68ebc7a28a219d3",
      "originalText": "桐生院トレーナー",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "8c51cee05a0373add9c05b6a4cc737da",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900600-Kashimoto-Riko/edu-306.kojo",
      "key": "welcome",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "welcome",
        "lines",
        4,
        "content",
        8
      ],
      "originalHash": "088c805ae75f4c6b981503a0f70503a812753874e23f2edd7a13d8e661af1abc",
      "sourceFileHash": "c706c7c01be957fb7efdada160ee5b16a13adb7e9bba1f79b68ebc7a28a219d3",
      "originalText": "か、理事長室の彼女を訪ねるように。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "fbeb92dc53b94865145461aea85e742b",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900600-Kashimoto-Riko/edu-306.kojo",
      "key": "welcome",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "welcome",
        "lines",
        5
      ],
      "originalHash": "8733796aed14a0f8330425a73cff095284e1165328bd7a66f7fe8adce04d08f4",
      "sourceFileHash": "c706c7c01be957fb7efdada160ee5b16a13adb7e9bba1f79b68ebc7a28a219d3",
      "originalText": "そう伝えると、%CHARA% は去っていった。代理理事長の胸の内に、うっすらとした不満が澱んでいる——%YOU% には、そう感じられた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "5f7e971832ca4ea03634dc8e8e044656",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900600-Kashimoto-Riko/edu-306.kojo",
