      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "task_fail",
        "lines",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "9884cddbc9ec7fbf8d9f3ca4cbe600a25a8461ff602f47dd3d228bd5d0a3981f",
      "sourceFileHash": "c706c7c01be957fb7efdada160ee5b16a13adb7e9bba1f79b68ebc7a28a219d3",
      "originalText": "%CHARA% は、声を荒げて責めることはしなかった。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "6f945f0e16d6a6ee60aa5038aa86f4c6",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900600-Kashimoto-Riko/edu-306.kojo",
      "key": "task_fail",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "task_fail",
        "lines",
        2
      ],
      "originalHash": "b6ba99da6ca32939bc21bfb8ed1ec41bbb340c0019714766ea4bad617219d7d6",
      "sourceFileHash": "c706c7c01be957fb7efdada160ee5b16a13adb7e9bba1f79b68ebc7a28a219d3",
      "originalText": "ふたりの担当をなだめたあと、彼女は %YOU% と並んで、黙ったまま学園の中を歩いた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "60c5878dc21d462c8d51b7a420ced167",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900600-Kashimoto-Riko/edu-306.kojo",
      "key": "task_fail",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "task_fail",
        "lines",
        3,
        "lines",
        0
      ],
      "originalHash": "983954a74551657e9c06a10d524845fd9f9cc43a07b7ad5f3b265ed056b51e4c",
      "sourceFileHash": "c706c7c01be957fb7efdada160ee5b16a13adb7e9bba1f79b68ebc7a28a219d3",
      "originalText": "トレーナー室が近づいて、ようやく淡く口を開いた。全力は、尽くしたのか、と。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "3ec6239bd9e01c9ec7cfb9aa82db45d6",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900600-Kashimoto-Riko/edu-306.kojo",
      "key": "task_fail",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "task_fail",
        "lines",
        3,
        "lines",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "25d5c9579b1631722c351fe0751b10f53abb2406dd782efbf0df564ede29418c",
      "sourceFileHash": "c706c7c01be957fb7efdada160ee5b16a13adb7e9bba1f79b68ebc7a28a219d3",
      "originalText": "%YOU% が答えるより先に、彼女はトレーナー室へと歩いていった。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "7ff5e64394511239b68b77595a182478",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900600-Kashimoto-Riko/edu-306.kojo",
      "key": "task_fail",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "task_fail",
        "lines",
        3,
        "lines",
        2
      ],
      "originalHash": "438bcac15abf9fa9e4e83c42a3c6fb9cf5b46826d838326826cc727f4d1d3364",
      "sourceFileHash": "c706c7c01be957fb7efdada160ee5b16a13adb7e9bba1f79b68ebc7a28a219d3",
      "originalText": "%YOU% はその場に立ち尽くし、学園に流れる、%B_UMA%の二度目の機会についての噂を思い出した。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "622af590c6d2239c625b052a14d6bf86",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900600-Kashimoto-Riko/edu-306.kojo",
      "key": "task_fail",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "task_fail",
        "lines",
